# App image (preditr.dockerfile: COPY . /app) should carry only the running app.
# Genome/annotation/maps ship in the per-organism preditr-ref images and are read
# at runtime from PREDITR_REFERENCES_PATH; build/deploy tooling is not needed in
# the app image. See references/docs/compose-reference-images.md.
#
# NOTE: the reference-image build (references/build_reference_image.sh) uses its
# own temp build context, so it is unaffected by this file and still ships maps/.

maps/
references/
run/
.git/
.claude/
**/.DS_Store
